# tests/

Integration tests for the `udex-sdk` package, covering JWT-based authentication with an embedded server and OAuth2 client credentials flow with Hydra. Tests verify the full SDK client lifecycle, token management, and server connectivity under TLS.

## Files

- `integration_tests.rs` -- Integration test suite with JWT and Hydra fixtures, server readiness polling, and parametrized test cases
